    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>index</code> - the parameter index</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>the Cassandra <code>DataType</code> or null if the parameter type cannot be determined from\n        <a href=\"../../core/mapping/CassandraSimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraSimpleTypeHolder</code></a></dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"../../core/mapping/CassandraSimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraSimpleTypeHolder</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../core/mapping/CassandraType.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraType</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>index</code> - 参数索引</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>Cassandra <code>DataType</code>，或者如果无法从<a href=\"../../core/mapping/CassandraSimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraSimpleTypeHolder</code></a>确定参数类型，则返回 null</dd>\n<dt>另见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list\">\n<li><a href=\"../../core/mapping/CassandraSimpleTypeHolder.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraSimpleTypeHolder</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../core/mapping/CassandraType.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>CassandraType</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
